          "short": "$\\frac{4\\sqrt{5}-4\\sqrt{2}}{3}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{2}}&=\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{2}}\\times\\frac{\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{2}}\\\\\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{2}}&=\\frac{4\\sqrt{5}-4\\sqrt{2}}{5-2}\\\\\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{2}}&=\\frac{4\\sqrt{5}-4\\sqrt{2}}{3}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 40
